{
  "manifest": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "body": "# AR-RAPHU v2 停止线验证报告\n\n停止线前的计算已完成；科学门槛与计算完成状态分开报告。",
        "id": "title",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "body": "## 技术摘要\n\nPhase 1 总体状态为 `FAILED`。当前证据只支持保守的 rank-1 预测组件；M9/M10 未获得升级资格，Phase 2 未启动。失败门槛：AR-S1 support false-positive rate；AR-S3 support recall。",
        "id": "technical-summary",
        "sourceId": "scenario-evidence",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "body": "## 场景级预测表现\n\nRMSE 与 R² 是 10 个 screening test 种子的均值；高 R² 不能代替外生支持恢复证据。",
        "id": "rmse-header",
        "sourceId": "scenario-evidence",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "chartId": "scenario-rmse",
        "id": "rmse-chart-block",
        "type": "chart"
      },
      {
        "body": "## 支持恢复\n\n支持召回率与假阳性率按每个种子、每个候选变量汇总。",
        "id": "support-header",
        "sourceId": "support-evidence",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "chartId": "support-rates",
        "id": "support-chart-block",
        "type": "chart"
      },
      {
        "body": "## M8 rank 审计\n\nE2/M8 formal bootstrap 按用户指令停止，状态为 `NOT_YET_RUN`；不作 rank 显著性结论。超参数在 SVD/bootstrap 前由 validation-only one-SE 冻结，已有的部分 critical-30 结果不参与结论。",
        "id": "rank-audit",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "body": "## 模型比较\n\n相对 RMSE 增益为正才表示候选模型优于参照：\n\n- E2 M7 vs M5: -3.33%\n- E2 M8 vs M7: -0.43%\n- E3 M6 vs M5: -0.12%",
        "id": "model-comparison",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "body": "## 限制与结论边界\n\n- 10 种子 test 已在先前筛选中打开；critical-30 被提前停止且不作为证据。\n- 高预测拟合可由 AR 持续性承担，不能证明机制识别。\n- AR-S3 支持失败阻止有效的 rank-2 power 结论。\n- TEP、Debutanizer、Gas Turbine、私有 CZ 和多晶棒不在本次证据范围。",
        "id": "limitations",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "body": "## 阶段状态\n\n- `COMPLETED` — Phase 0 protocol and implementation: Frozen v2 semantics, tests, leakage guards, and runtime.\n- `FAILED` — Phase 1 synthetic: AR-S0 through AR-S7 screening completed, but support gates failed; critical-30 and bootstrap were stopped by the user.\n- `NOT_APPLICABLE` — M9 rank-2 and M10 full surface upgrade: No external variable passed all frozen upgrade gates.\n- `NOT_YET_RUN` — Phase 2 TEP: Stopped before Phase 2 because the Phase 1 gate did not pass.\n- `NOT_YET_RUN` — Phase 3 Debutanizer and Gas Turbine: Phase 2 has not been completed.\n- `NOT_APPLICABLE` — Phase 4 private CZ: Excluded by user on 2026-07-25; private data was not read.\n- `NOT_APPLICABLE` — Phase 5 multi-rod CZ: Excluded by user and no additional rods are in scope.",
        "id": "phase-status",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "body": "## 建议的下一步\n\n1. 不启动 Phase 2，也不启用 M9/M10。\n2. 如需继续，先由用户批准新的 Phase 1 预注册版本，在新 namespace 中修正支持筛选并补齐 AR-S3 power。\n3. 若不修改方案，则按“高预测拟合、有限外生支持证据、无 rank-2 升级依据”封存。",
        "id": "next-steps",
        "type": "markdown"
      }
    ],
